   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "答案是不安全。",
   "spoken": "答案是不安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 3.98,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 4.078,
   "speechEnd": 5.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "委托写在账户的链上代码里，独立于链下的提现系统。",
   "spoken": "委托写在账户的链上代码里，独立于链下的提现系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 6.48,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 6.578,
   "speechEnd": 10.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "在新的授权覆盖或者清零它之前，委托合约照样可以被调用。",
   "spoken": "在新的授权覆盖或者清零它之前，委托合约照样可以被掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 11.476,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 11.574,
   "speechEnd": 16.395
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "Binance 在 10 月 30 日 0 点 10 分，才把委托清零。",
   "spoken": "Binance 在 10 月 30 日 0 点 10 分，才把委托清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.456,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 17.554,
   "speechEnd": 20.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "恶意委托在链上，存活了约 3 小时 50 分。",
   "spoken": "恶意委托在链上，存活了约 3 小时 50 分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.068,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 22.166,
   "speechEnd": 25.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "暂停提现，不等于撤销权限。",
   "spoken": "暂停提现，不等于撤销权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 26.176,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 26.274,
   "speechEnd": 28.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "交易所今天就能做三件事。",
   "spoken": "交易所今天就能做三件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 29.804,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 29.902,
   "speechEnd": 31.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "提前写好紧急撤销流程并且演练，把链上授权也算进去。",
   "spoken": "提前写好紧急撤销流程并且演练，把链上授权也算进去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 32.856,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 32.954,
   "speechEnd": 37.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "热钱包设余额上限，每条链单独熔断。",
   "spoken": "热钱包设余额上限，每条链单独熔断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 38.572,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 38.67,
   "speechEnd": 41.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "签名策略覆盖全部交易类型，包括 EIP-7702 授权。",
   "spoken": "签名策略覆盖全部交易类型，包括 EIP-7702 授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 42.992,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 43.09,
   "speechEnd": 48.28
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "spoken": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 49.332,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 49.43,
   "speechEnd": 51.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "充值前，确认交易所支持的代币合约地址和网络。",
   "spoken": "充值前，确认交易所支持的代币合约地址和网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 52.192,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 52.29,
   "speechEnd": 56.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "开启提币白名单和新地址冷却期，提币地址从地址簿里选。",
   "spoken": "开启提币白名单和新地址冷却期，提币地址从地址簿里选。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-13.mp3",
   "start": 57.332,
   "dur": 6.192,
   "speechStart": 57.43,
   "speechEnd": 62.691
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "来源不明的资金不要充进去，交易所要你补资料，只在官方 App 里处理。",
   "spoken": "来源不明的资金不要充进去，交易所要你补资料，只在官方 App 里楚理。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg6-14.mp3",
   "start": 63.744,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 63.842,
   "speechEnd": 68.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "保管者要让签名只为真实的订单服务，检查站要拦住赃款，也别误伤普通人。",
   "spoken": "保管者要让签名只为真实的订单服务，检查站要拦住赃款，也别误伤普通人。",
